  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Currently, for both the Marketplace and the Inventory, when examining a Loading Screen, you can see a small 3D render of the loading screen facing a single direction, with a very small degree of movement in it's own preview menu. What if there was a button to make it \"Full Screen\", where you will be taken into the loading screen itself to be able to fully experience it. \n\nThis option could also be available in the Inventory. \n\nWorlds can load quite quickly, so we can't enjoy the Loading Screens we pay for for any more than a few fleeting seconds. A dedicated option to be in the Loading Screen in Full-Screen/VR for as long as you want would benefit potential buyers, as well as letting people experience what they've paid for for as long as they please.",
